abstract: >-
  Code and aggregate research materials for the minor-revision snapshot prepared
  on 8 October 2026 of Temporal validation of liver metastasis risk enrichment at
  diagnosis in T1 and T2 gallbladder cancer using SEER registry data. Associated
  manuscript authors, in order: Wenhao Chen, Peng Pan, Jinlu Wei, Zhanjin Wang,
  Kaihao Du, Weiwei Xue, and Zhan Wang. Individual-level SEER data, case-level
  predictions and SHAP values, and fitted estimators are excluded. MIT covers
  software and associated software documentation only; other materials have
  separate rights as described in docs/LICENSING.md. The article is under review.
keywords:
  - gallbladder cancer
  - liver metastasis
  - SEER
  - temporal validation
  - risk enrichment
  - registry-input recoding
